            "review_title": "Review at Gem Café",
            "review_text": "CocoTampa123\nPerth, Australia1811 contributions\n0\nGreat Breakfast\nJun 2025 • Family\nWent to GEM twice for breakfast and enjoyed.\n\nService is excellent, being attentive, polite and prompt. \n\nThe menu is quite limited (for breakfast), but what we had both days was very very enjoyable, if we stayed longer would have had breakfast there again. \n\nVery nice decor and very well laid out.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 1, 2025",
